{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TITANS have long been mere stories, but soon twin protagonists Torden and Jorden are going to experience the thunderous rise of the long-dormant creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by Celtic mythology, TITANKIN Prologue takes you on a tight JRPG-style adventure where you'll meet plenty of colourful characters, wield the power of TITANS, and enjoy thoughtful turn-based battles in a delightfully crafted pixel-art world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1451760/extras/b1e742f28cca321b0c1f7a1d7416b6c5.avif?t=1758558476\" width=616 height=290 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Strategic Turn-Based Combat</strong><br>Each enemy you encounter has distinct strengths and weaknesses - discover and employ your own strategies to quickly overthrow the enemy.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Command TITANS</strong><br>Defeating each TITAN will yield a KINSTONE- equip one on a character and they\u2019ll benefit from enhanced stat growth, as well as the ability to call upon the TITAN in battle!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1451760/extras/047975377b376c0b2c53ac936c59d6f2.poster.avif?t=1758558476\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1451760/extras/047975377b376c0b2c53ac936c59d6f2.webm?t=1758558476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1451760/extras/047975377b376c0b2c53ac936c59d6f2.mp4?t=1758558476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>The Classic JRPG, Modernized</strong><br>No random encounters: on-map enemies will chase or run from the player, and superior balancing removes the need to grind for levels. Save points within a dungeon will also fully restore the party!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vibrant Celtic-Mythology Setting</strong><br>You will meet, battle, and recruit creatures and entities inspired by famous and obscure mythical stories of Ireland, Scotland, Wales, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Short and Sweet</strong><br>This opening act of the TITANKIN saga won't devour all your time- if you love JRPGs but don't have 50+ hours to spend on a juggernaut, TITANKIN Prologue will leave you feeling fulfilled.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1451760?t=1758558476","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1451760/115d1f766652716a0f375c56efbf20a02312e32e/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758558476","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1451760/46e22c5d0b85f4ac720497d02960feb4e243b626/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758558476","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1451760/46e22c5d0b85f4ac720497d02960feb4e243b626/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758558476","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TITANS have long been mere stories, but soon twin protagonists Torden and Jorden are going to experience the thunderous rise of the long-dormant creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by Celtic mythology, TITANKIN Prologue takes you on a tight JRPG-style adventure where you'll meet plenty of colourful characters, wield the power of TITANS, and enjoy thoughtful turn-based battles in a delightfully crafted pixel-art world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1451760/extras/b1e742f28cca321b0c1f7a1d7416b6c5.avif?t=1758558476\" width=616 height=290 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Strategic Turn-Based Combat</strong><br>Each enemy you encounter has distinct strengths and weaknesses - discover and employ your own strategies to quickly overthrow the enemy.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Command TITANS</strong><br>Defeating each TITAN will yield a KINSTONE- equip one on a character and they\u2019ll benefit from enhanced stat growth, as well as the ability to call upon the TITAN in battle!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1451760/extras/047975377b376c0b2c53ac936c59d6f2.poster.avif?t=1758558476\" width=616 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1451760/extras/047975377b376c0b2c53ac936c59d6f2.webm?t=1758558476\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1451760/extras/047975377b376c0b2c53ac936c59d6f2.mp4?t=1758558476\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>The Classic JRPG, Modernized</strong><br>No random encounters: on-map enemies will chase or run from the player, and superior balancing removes the need to grind for levels. Save points within a dungeon will also fully restore the party!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vibrant Celtic-Mythology Setting</strong><br>You will meet, battle, and recruit creatures and entities inspired by famous and obscure mythical stories of Ireland, Scotland, Wales, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Short and Sweet</strong><br>This opening act of the TITANKIN saga won't devour all your time- if you love JRPGs but don't have 50+ hours to spend on a juggernaut, TITANKIN Prologue will leave you feeling fulfilled.</p></li></ul>","developers":["FerfWorks"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1451760/be7a49d4769ada3a4181289a32b88ab192bb62e4/header.jpg?t=1758558476","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1451760/382367734/33db5fd26573bd86ebddc3ec3fb699e873b930c3/1756895303/dash_av1.mpd?t=1757002725","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1451760/382367734/33db5fd26573bd86ebddc3ec3fb699e873b930c3/1756895303/dash_h264.mpd?t=1757002725","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1451760/382367734/33db5fd26573bd86ebddc3ec3fb699e873b930c3/1756895303/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1757002725","id":257192577,"name":"TITANKIN: Prologue - 2.0 Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257192577/dadac78f4eeecaa44fdc1e611d85c7c534cf4032/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1757002725"}],"name":"TITANKIN: Prologue","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text":"TITANKIN: Prologue - $9.99 USD","packageid":512633,"percent_savings":0,"percent_savings_text":" ","price_in_cents_with_discount":999}],"title":"Buy TITANKIN: Prologue"}],"packages":[512633],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Microsoft\u00ae Windows\u00ae 7/8/8.1/10 (32bit/64bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core2 Duo or bett